  m_text: "<color=#FAB84C>\xBB</color>  <b>Runtime API:</b> constraint.SetBoundsSource(CameraConstraint.BoundsType.BoxCollider2D,
    box), SetEdgePadding(f), SetAxisConstraint(x, y, z), UpdateBounds(), GetConstraintBounds(out
    min, out max), IsAtEdge(...).\n<color=#FAB84C>\xBB</color>  <b>Scene workflow:</b>
    Select Main Camera: CameraConstraint (bounds type, source, padding, axes) and
    MouseMover2D (DeltaRaw) are Inspector fields. The padding slider calls SetEdgePadding
    directly.\n<color=#FAB84C>\xBB</color>  <b>Verification:</b> Drag up and down;
    Jump up / down throw the camera far away and it snaps back to the edge. Zoom
    out past the bounds width and X is pinned to the centre."
